  "title": "Wednesday Cookies",
  "description": "This is light, soft cookie, flavored with vanilla, and topped with a fluffy icing. Pretty just as they are, or decorated for special occasions and holidays.",
  "authors": [
    "LuAnn Wagner"
  ],
